     "text": "I knew this would happen.",
     "start": 692.006,
     "end": 692.842
    },
    {
     "text": "It was always going to be one of us.\"",
     "start": 693.858,
     "end": 695.229
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 140,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "\"No.",
     "start": 695.99,
     "end": 696.205
    },
    {
     "text": "No, we can fix this, we just stop saying her name, we...\"",
     "start": 696.761,
     "end": 699.637
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 141,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "\"It's not about her name,\" Emma says.",
     "start": 700.694,
     "end": 702.461
    },
    {
     "text": "\"It's about who you remember.\"",
     "start": 703.428,
     "end": 704.706
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 142,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "She reaches over and puts her hand on yours.",
     "start": 705.834,
     "end": 707.881
    },
    {
     "text": "You can barely feel it.",
     "start": 709.018,
     "end": 709.886
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 143,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "\"Don't forget me,\" she whispers.",
     "start": 710.961,
     "end": 712.528
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Okay?",
     "start": 713.354,
     "end": 713.676
    },
    {
     "text": "Whatever happens.",
     "start": 714.394,
     "end": 715.043
    },
    {
     "text": "Just don't...\"",
     "start": 715.938,
     "end": 716.505
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 144,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "You look back at the road for one second.",
     "start": 717.721,
     "end": 719.341
    },
    {
     "text": "One second, to make the turn.",
     "start": 720.074,
     "end": 721.852
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 145,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "When you look back, the passenger seat is empty.",
     "start": 722.949,
     "end": 725.565
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 146,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Emma's seatbelt is still buckled.",
     "start": 726.659,
     "end": 727.995
    },
    {
     "text": "Across nothing.",
     "start": 728.872,
     "end": 729.489
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 147,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "In the back seat, Lily climbs forward and sits down where Emma was.",
     "start": 730.469,
     "end": 734.861
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 148,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "She buckles her own seatbelt.",
     "start": 735.809,
     "end": 736.941
    },
    {
     "text": "She turns the radio to your favorite station.",
     "start": 737.956,
     "end": 739.853
    },
    {
     "text": "She puts her hand on yours.",
     "start": 740.893,
     "end": 742.137
    },
    {
     "text": "It's warm.",
     "start": 742.866,
     "end": 743.275
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 149,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "\"Babe,\" she says.",
     "start": 744.075,
     "end": 745.189
    },
    {
     "text": "\"You missed our exit.\"",
     "start": 745.519,
     "end": 746.299
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 150,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Two weeks later, it's Christmas.",
     "start": 747.68,
     "end": 749.472
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 151,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "You drive back down to the white farmhouse.",
     "start": 750.539,
     "end": 752.471
    },
    {
     "text": "You don't remember deciding to.",
     "start": 753.325,
     "end": 755.148
    },
    {
     "text": "Your hands just knew the way.",
     "start": 755.876,
     "end": 757.212
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 152,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Diane hugs you at the door.",
     "start": 758.212,
     "end": 759.369
    },
    {
     "text": "She smells like cinnamon and dish soap.",
     "start": 759.979,
     "end": 761.74
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 153,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Frank shakes your hand.",
     "start": 762.511,
     "end": 763.441
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 154,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "This time he looks right at you, and his eyes are empty and calm and happy.",
     "start": 764.253,
     "end": 769.27
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 155,
   "sentences": [
