     "end": 816.268
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 167,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "You turn it over.",
     "start": 817.052,
     "end": 817.653
    },
    {
     "text": "The handwriting on the back has changed.",
     "start": 818.512,
     "end": 820.102
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Lily.",
     "start": 820.938,
     "end": 821.328
    },
    {
     "text": "Summer 2009.\"",
     "start": 821.775,
     "end": 822.773
    },
    {
     "text": "Just one name now.",
     "start": 823.618,
     "end": 824.428
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 168,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "You open your mouth to say it.",
     "start": 825.336,
     "end": 826.644
    },
    {
     "text": "The other name.",
     "start": 827.308,
     "end": 827.795
    },
    {
     "text": "The one you promised you wouldn't forget.",
     "start": 828.597,
     "end": 830.025
    },
    {
     "text": "And you realize you can't remember it.",
     "start": 830.943,
     "end": 832.856
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 169,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "You know there was someone.",
     "start": 833.816,
     "end": 834.894
    },
    {
     "text": "You know she drew little spirals in the margins of her notebook.",
     "start": 835.682,
     "end": 838.346
    },
    {
     "text": "You know she was funny in a quiet way.",
     "start": 839.056,
     "end": 840.868
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 170,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "You know she had a sister.",
     "start": 841.757,
     "end": 842.745
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 171,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "But your girlfriend's mom looks at you across the table, and her smile is glued exactly where it should be, and she says the thing you'll hear in your head for the rest of your life.",
     "start": 843.668,
     "end": 852.225
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 172,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "\"Sweetheart, Lily's our only daughter.\"",
     "start": 853.027,
     "end": 855.41
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 173,
   "sentences": [
